CM_ SG_ 593 UI_SET_SPEED "Contributor live capture reports byte2 as the retained dash set speed in mph, factor 1.0; retained public/Span excerpts contain no set-speed adjustment and remain zero.";

CM_ BO_ 387 "Camry retained August/September object lifecycle: each slot B4[7] starts a new track; B5[4] ends the old track and can coincide with a new one. B5[1:0] is a raw object state: zero includes empty and unqualified retained geometry. Individual nonzero state names remain unassigned.";

CM_ BO_ 388 "Camry retained August/September object lifecycle: each slot B4[7] starts a new track; B5[4] ends the old track and can coincide with a new one. B5[1:0] is a raw object state: zero includes empty and unqualified retained geometry. Individual nonzero state names remain unassigned.";

CM_ BO_ 389 "Camry retained August/September object lifecycle: each slot B4[7] starts a new track; B5[4] ends the old track and can coincide with a new one. B5[1:0] is a raw object state: zero includes empty and unqualified retained geometry. Individual nonzero state names remain unassigned.";
